      "why": "Unrolled_k is the best of the multi-cycle families for throughput (k=8 gives the fewest cycles/result). A small probe with k=8, N=4..8, W=14..16 is included only to confirm that even this family cannot reach 250 MSPS; if it fails, iterative will also fail, so no further budget is spent there.",
